# Objects held in a variable or structure of C, and how each is named to
# the collector. See tests/check-c-held-objects.sh for the rule and for
# what each way means.
#
# file:name                          how          where it is named
xpost_op_path.c:_arc_start_proc      context      ctx->arcstartproc, which the context's root list declares
xpost_op_path.c:_gstate_cache        reached      a slot of the graphics state, which privatedict holds
